{
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "art-fix5b houses",
      "description": "Songbird Aviary (birdbath water rebuilt as one non-overlapping stepped slab; bowl and foot stepped instead of four overlapping turned boxes), Rookery (leaf clumps moved out along their branches onto new twigs, trinkets moved off the bird spots), Rabbit Hutch (vanilla-style carrots: tapered stepped body and two crossed cut-out leaf planes; gable boxes inset from the walls and each other; round window frame pieces 0.5 apart and the pane rebuilt as three non-overlapping boxes; water dish and lettuce stepped). Models pass Machinaria sizecheck, holes and zfight (local).",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "model_render",
          "name": "SongbirdAviary",
          "arguments": {
            "root": "projects",
            "path": "CozyTales-Ranching/src/main/resources/Server/Item/Items/CozyRanch/Houses/CozyRanch_House_SongbirdAviary.json",
